    "detailed_description": "<strong>Car Wash TD, a simple one-of-a-kind tower defense game.</strong><br><strong>Goal: wash cars before they reach the end of the road.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/d2bf453f67f89032623f930e74838075.poster.avif?t=1642794713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/d2bf453f67f89032623f930e74838075.webm?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/d2bf453f67f89032623f930e74838075.mp4?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You have been hired by the government to create a system that washes cars directly on the road. To achieve your mandate, you have at your disposal water turrets of many kinds and many more advanced technologies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/86ead34fbd4c3c196ebccdb80be125cf.avif?t=1642794713\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/319e00109199fcf5568ee1912cde9e86.poster.avif?t=1642794713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/319e00109199fcf5568ee1912cde9e86.webm?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/319e00109199fcf5568ee1912cde9e86.mp4?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Unleash your creativity and puzzle solving skills by creating mazes to make the path of the cars longer and increase the efficiency of your towers. Don\u2019t worry about causing traffic, cleaning cars is your priority.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/bebe7d2fe6b01b8615cc87a7f5b2406f.avif?t=1642794713\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/114fecf5728805b9c3043791d3e1c528.poster.avif?t=1642794713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/114fecf5728805b9c3043791d3e1c528.webm?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/114fecf5728805b9c3043791d3e1c528.mp4?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/e73f86a054191c760acf58d8e2653cf5.avif?t=1642794713\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/d49412085cc5b4de71bb9676c9363938.poster.avif?t=1642794713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/d49412085cc5b4de71bb9676c9363938.webm?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/d49412085cc5b4de71bb9676c9363938.mp4?t=1642794713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1732660/extras/9eb0f600d56866cf03e4fdd9f3741952.avif?t=1642794713\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/